2026-10-02T13:08:05.2321772Z -- Input staleness watchdog (item 12)
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2322653Z   ok   a fresh sensor reads normally
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2323434Z   ok   an over-age value is rejected
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2324477Z   ok   the rejected value is still available for a graceful fallback
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2325431Z   ok   the age is reported so a user can see why
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2326313Z   ok   an outdoor reading may be older than an indoor one
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2327172Z   ok   the watchdog can be switched off entirely
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2327863Z   ok   the age limit can be relaxed
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2328458Z   ok   a future-stamped state is stale, not age 0
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2329196Z   ok   a 4 h backward host-clock step flags the reading stale
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2329989Z   ok   unavailable is distinguished from stale
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2331084Z   ok   a missing entity is reported as such
