2026-10-02T13:08:05.2779428Z -- The discharge law: the valve regulates flow temperature (item 29)
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2779957Z   ok   the flow setpoint is the target plus the standing loss over the emitter UA
2026-10-02T13:08:05.2780493Z   ok   and collapses to the target when there is nothing to hold against
