2026-10-02T13:13:48.1517690Z 
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1518071Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1518662Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1519366Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1519997Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1520781Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1521189Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1521631Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1522107Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1522585Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1523051Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1523560Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1523863Z 
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1524406Z -- Channel pin semantics
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1524870Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1525355Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1525764Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1526141Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1526719Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1527084Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1527485Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1527906Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1528392Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1528910Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1529231Z 
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1529377Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1529770Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1530227Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1530637Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1531016Z   ok   from_dict rejects a missing expiry
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1531254Z 
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1531432Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1531853Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1532309Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1532709Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1533081Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1533490Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1534291Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1534901Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1535338Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1535586Z 
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1535809Z -- Safety release fires only when a hard floor binds
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1536248Z   ok   forcing space off in the cold releases pins for the comfort floor
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1536664Z   ok   released space steps actually run again
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1537060Z   ok   forcing space off when it is not needed releases nothing
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1537482Z   ok   forcing hot water off with a low tank releases pins
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1537889Z   ok   a due legionella cycle is released when forced off
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1538328Z   ok   forcing hot water off when the tank is hot releases nothing
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1538590Z 
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1538805Z -- A timezone-less expiry is handled, not crashed on
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1539185Z   ok   a naive expiry does not raise TypeError
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1539583Z   ok   the stored expiry is comparable with the parsed slots
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1540004Z   ok   and the override can still be applied to the horizon
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1540427Z   ok   a naive expiry in the past is rejected as a plan error
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1540661Z 
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1540907Z -- Abandoning an unsafe plan does not discard the safe channel
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1541296Z   ok   the breaching channel is abandoned
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1541657Z   ok   the channel that was never unsafe keeps its pins
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1542037Z   ok   so the space plan the user asked for still holds
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1542262Z 
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1542508Z -- A released pin is never reported without being planned around
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1542924Z   ok   a plan that never converges still terminates
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1543284Z   ok   giving up releases every forced-off slot
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1543795Z   ok   the abandoned plan is as warm as planning freely
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1544345Z   ok   and it heats about as much as planning freely
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1544554Z 
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1544717Z -- No override leaves behaviour unchanged
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1545096Z   ok   winter_dhw: passing no pins is byte-for-byte identical
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1545507Z   ok   winter_dhw: no pins means the override is inactive
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1545897Z   ok   summer: passing no pins is byte-for-byte identical
2026-10-02T13:13:48.1546287Z   ok   summer: no pins means the override is inactive
